-- title:
--   A Galois S-level absorbing p-power idèle classes
-- statement:
--   Fix a prime $p$ and a finite set $S$ of primes containing $p$. Let $L\subseteq F$ be intermediate fields of $\overline{\mathbb Q}/\mathbb Q$, both finite over $\mathbb Q$, and assume $F$ is unramified outside $S$ in the sense of `IsUnramifiedOutside`: $F/\mathbb Q$ is finite and, for every prime $q\notin S$ and every valuation subring $A$ of $\overline{\mathbb Q}$ with $q$ a non-unit of $A$, the image in $\mathrm{Gal}(\overline{\mathbb Q}/\mathbb Q)$ of the inertia subgroup of $A$ over $\mathbb Q$ lies in the fixing subgroup of $F$. The assertion is the existence of an intermediate field $F_2$, finite over $\mathbb Q$, unramified outside $S$ in the same sense, Galois over $\mathbb Q$, with $F\le F_2$, such that the following holds. Write $K$ for $F$ regarded as an intermediate field over $L$ (`levelField L F`) and $K_2$ likewise for $F_2$. Then for every $K$-algebra structure on $K_2$ whose structure map is compatible with the inclusions into $\overline{\mathbb Q}$, and every unit $z$ of the adèle ring $\mathbb A_K$ of $K$: if $z^{p^k}$ lies, for some $k\in\mathbb N$, in the subgroup $K^\times\cdot U_K^S$ generated by the principal idèles (the image of $K^\times$) together with the idèles that are units (themselves and their inverses integral) at every finite place $w$ of $K$ not lying under a prime of $\mathcal O_L$ above a prime of $S$, then the image of $z$ under the units map of the ring homomorphism $\beta$ of the genuine base change $\mathbb A_K\to\mathbb A_{K_2}$ lies in the corresponding subgroup $K_2^\times\cdot U_{K_2}^S$ of $\mathbb A_{K_2}^\times$. Archimedean components are unconstrained in $U^S$.
--
--   This is a capitulation statement in the tower of $S$-ramified extensions: passing to a suitable finite Galois $S$-level makes an idèle whose $p$-power lies in $K^\times U_K^S$ itself land in $K_2^\times U_{K_2}^S$ after base change. It is a repackaging, for level fields over $L$, full (rather than finite) idèles and the genuine adèle base change, of [`NumberField.exists_le_isGalois_forall_mem_range_sup_unitIdelesOutside_of_pow_mem`](thm.html#NumberField.exists_le_isGalois_forall_mem_range_sup_unitIdelesOutside_of_pow_mem), and is used in the construction of level-wise $S$-unit representatives for coboundaries in [`NumberField.LevelArith.exists_level_sUnitsRep_val_d_eq_of_sIdele_coboundary_of_map_eq_add_d`](thm.html#NumberField.LevelArith.exists_level_sUnitsRep_val_d_eq_of_sIdele_coboundary_of_map_eq_add_d).
